                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Sixty years ago, President Lyndon B. Johnson signed a law creating Medicare and Medicaid. These programs continue to be essential for thousands of my constituents in Queens. But right now, health care coverage is at risk for more than a million New Yorkers. We cannot stop fighting to protect the lifesaving care so many Americans rely on.",
