                "text": "A government shutdown is just 8 days away. Millions of Americans could see their insurance premiums skyrocket.\n\nDemocrats are ready to pass a bipartisan bill that lowers costs and makes health care affordable for all Americans.\n\nThe GOP majority is refusing to come to the table.\nhttps://t.co/1QpkoYpzom",
