                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Seniors in Queens & across the country are deeply concerned about the GOP's devastating cuts to Medicaid.\n\nThis week at India Home and the Newtown Senior Center, I listened to residents share their concerns. I\u2019m fighting to reverse these cuts and preserve vital tax credits that help keep health care costs low for thousands of Queens families.",
