                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "As a mom of two boys, I know how critical it is for women and families to have access to affordable health care.\n\nIf health insurance tax credits expire, people like cancer survivor Laura Packard will be among those most at risk.\n\nDemocrats aren\u2019t forcing a shutdown\u2014we\u2019re working to protect women and families from rising health care costs.",
